#: ../../source/api/kit.rst:2
msgid "xent-kit"
msgstr "xent-kit"

#: ../../../xent-kit/include/xtk/xtk_batch.h:238
msgid ""
"Copies string and bytes. The caller may free them. `len > 0` with a NULL "
"pointer fails and appends nothing. A resource id is copied; `res_retain` "
"is not called."
msgstr ""
"拷贝字符串与字节切片，调用方随后可释放原内存。当 `len > 0` 且指针为 NULL 时返回失败且保持批次原样；资源 ID 按值拷贝。"

#: ../../../xent-kit/include/xtk/xtk_batch.h:243
msgid "Borrows `arg` until unsubscribe or the host is destroyed."
msgstr "借用 `arg` 直至取消订阅或宿主销毁。"

#: ../../../xent-kit/include/xtk/xtk_host.h:13
msgid ""
"`string` and `bytes` point at the host's stored copy, until that property"
" changes or the host is destroyed."
msgstr "`string` 与 `bytes` 指向宿主内部保存的副本，有效至该属性下次变更或宿主销毁为止。"

#: ../../../xent-kit/include/xtk/xtk_event.h:56
msgid "`string` and `query.text` are valid only for the duration of the callback."
msgstr "`string` 与 `query.text` 仅在本次回调函数执行期间有效。"

#: ../../../xent-kit/include/xtk/xtk_reconcile.h:105
msgid "Must run on the thread that created `rt`."
msgstr "在创建 `rt` 的同一线程上调用。"

#: ../../../xent-kit/include/xtk/xtk_reconcile.h:107
msgid ""
"Must run on the thread that created `rt`. Copies `data`; the caller may "
"free it. `len > 0` with NULL `data` is rejected."
msgstr "在创建 `rt` 的同一线程上调用。拷贝 `data` ，调用方随后可释放；当 `len > 0` 且 `data` 为 NULL 时拒绝投递。"
